  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">AI&#160;문항&#160;생성기</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">잘&#160;활용하고&#160;계시죠?</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/I6d/304\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/I6d/304</a><br><br></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"Daum 카페\" data-og-description=\"\" data-og-host=\"cafe.daum.net\" data-og-source-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/I6d/304\" data-og-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/_c21_/bbs_read?grpid=1TaBA&amp;fldid=I6d&amp;datanum=304\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/I6d/304\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/I6d/304\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">Daum 카페</p><p class=\"og-desc\"></p><p class=\"og-host\">cafe.daum.net</p></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">이번에는&#160;<br>이런&#160;고민을&#160;해&#160;보았습니다.</p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"Daum 카페\" data-og-description=\"\" data-og-host=\"cafe.daum.net\" data-og-source-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/I6d/304\" data-og-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/_c21_/bbs_read?grpid=1TaBA&amp;fldid=I6d&amp;datanum=304\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/I6d/304\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/I6d/304\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">Daum 카페</p><p class=\"og-desc\"></p><p class=\"og-host\">cafe.daum.net</p></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table data-ke-type=\"table\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\" style=\"width: 44.3884%;\" border=\"1\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width: 100%;\">탐구질문 :<br><b>AI가 좋은 문항을 만들어 주는데</b><br><b>학생들이 이 문항을 해결하기 위해</b><br><b>나의 수업은 어떻게 바꿔야 할까?</b><br><b></b><br><b>AI가 만들어준&#160;<br>평가&#160;문항을&#160;넣으면<br>&#160;<br>수업 지도안도 AI가 만들 수 있지 않을까?</b></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">AI와 같이 논의하며&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#39;개념기반 탐구학습 설계 도우미&#39;<br>어플을 개발하였습니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">해당 어플은 총3단계로 구성되어 있습니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><b><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\">&lt;1단계&gt;</span></b></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">학년, 과목, 단원 및&#160; AI가 만들어준 평가문항 입력하기</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ca12b1d2b3b1ecb5f19033bdba3cb52d021146a8\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"497\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ca12b1d2b3b1ecb5f19033bdba3cb52d021146a8\" data-origin-width=\"1132\" data-origin-height=\"695\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b78d3045980fc2f9ce902003254639a3ed53abf1\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"642\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b78d3045980fc2f9ce902003254639a3ed53abf1\" data-origin-width=\"1055\" data-origin-height=\"792\"></div><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><b><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\">&lt;2단계&gt;</span></b></p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">세 가지 질문(사실적, 개념적, 논쟁적) 을 3개씩 제시해 주고, 원하는 질문들을 고르기</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/29f64e2cf9fa6d4a7144afa2a076930eaec92ea0\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"656\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/29f64e2cf9fa6d4a7144afa2a076930eaec92ea0\" data-origin-width=\"1156\" data-origin-height=\"727\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><b><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\">&lt;3단계&gt;</span></b></p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">3가지 질문 중심, 개념 기반 탐구학습 수업 설계안이 나옵니다!</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a71ca92a3ea8dbedd34affb9053c0dd4533e7f8a\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"640\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a71ca92a3ea8dbedd34affb9053c0dd4533e7f8a\" data-origin-width=\"987\" data-origin-height=\"807\"></div><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">*** 설계안 전체를</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#160; 한글파일(hwp) 로 다운 받으실 수 있습니다!</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/db88e03c30baa24efe63f4d114b014c575274757?download\" data-file-name=\"개념기반_탐구학습_설계안 (중학교 과학_밀도) (1).hwp\" data-file-size=\"45056\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DF1n%26dataid%3D981%26fileid%3D5%26regdt%3D20260606080106&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fdb88e03c30baa24efe63f4d114b014c575274757')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">개념기반_탐구학습_설계안 (중학교 과학_밀도) (1)</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">44.00KB</div></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">그럼</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">개념기반 탐구학습 교수학습 계획안</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">사용해보세요~</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #f2eb8d;\" data-ke-size=\"size26\"><a href=\"https://gemini.google.com/share/e7cf5f1100ee\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://gemini.google.com/share/e7cf5f1100ee</a></span></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"&#8206;Gemini - 개념기반 탐구학습 설계 도구\" data-og-description=\"Gemini로 생성됨\" data-og-host=\"gemini.google.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://gemini.google.com/share/e7cf5f1100ee\" data-og-url=\"https://gemini.google.com/share/e7cf5f1100ee\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/rQEHO/dJMb82ML9pk/21lRoXo8k94WcBnmD0F3aK/img.png?width=1920&amp;height=1080&amp;face=0_0_1920_1080,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/cbTDmE/dJMb887hLDH/bNAJeQr1k34vFszOhdCp3k/img.png?width=1920&amp;height=1080&amp;face=0_0_1920_1080\"><a href=\"https://gemini.google.com/share/e7cf5f1100ee\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://gemini.google.com/share/e7cf5f1100ee\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/rQEHO/dJMb82ML9pk/21lRoXo8k94WcBnmD0F3aK/img.png?width=1920&amp;height=1080&amp;face=0_0_1920_1080,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/cbTDmE/dJMb887hLDH/bNAJeQr1k34vFszOhdCp3k/img.png?width=1920&amp;height=1080&amp;face=0_0_1920_1080\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_imag